  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Norwegian human rights fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NHRF provides direct support to small, grassroots organizations in selected development countries that mobilize on the ground for the respect and promotion of human rights for marginalized and vulnerable groups, including gender equality.The NHRF supports local groups for victims of human rights violations and affected communities that take the lead in their own struggle for rights, as well as professional human rights advocates. They support local initiatives for protection of human rights defenders. They also have a few select strategic partnerships with global mechanism that work with human rights defenders.</narrative>
  </description>
